<title>SPAIN: DNIB issues 10 bln pta three-year matador.</title>
<headline>DNIB issues 10 bln pta three-year matador.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>De Nationale InvesteringsBank (DNIB) has issued a 10 billion pesetas three-year matador bond at par, with a coupon at 5.29215 percent, lead manager Argentaria Banco de Negocios said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The maturity date is April 14 2000, while the payment date is May 3 1997. Coupons are paid on January 7, 1998, 1999 and 2000.</p>
<p>Moody's rating for DNIB is AA3, while S&amp;P is AA+.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
